# Input

```svelte
<div>
    
    I need to adhere sadly</div>

<!-- prettier-ignore-start -->

<div      > format madness here </div>

<p>
    I'm
    freeeee!
</p>

<!-- prettier-ignore-end -->
<script>
    const a = true;
</script>

```


